# Rank 759 / CVE-2021-39182: EnroCrypt exposed an MD5 hashing helper.

test "rank759: EnroCrypt MD5 helper uses weak hash"
  lang python
  file hashing.py
  expect VYQL-CRY-001
  code
  ```
  import hashlib

  class Hashing:
      def MD5(self, data: str):
          sha = hashlib.md5(bytes(data.encode()))
          hash = str(sha.digest())
          return self.__Salt(hash, salt=self.salt)
  ```

test "rank759: EnroCrypt SHA256 helper is not weak hash"
  lang python
  file hashing.py
  reject VYQL-CRY-001
  code
  ```
  import hashlib

  class Hashing:
      def SHA256(self, data: str):
          sha = hashlib.sha256(bytes(data.encode()))
          hash = sha.digest()
          return self.__Salt(hash, salt=self.salt)
  ```
